msgid "Tax rate schedule"
msgstr "세율 일정"

#: models.py:358
msgid "Corporation ID"
msgstr "Corporation ID"

#: models.py:359
msgid "Taxed month"
msgstr "과세 월"

#: models.py:360
msgid "Taxed year"
msgstr "과세 연도"

#: models.py:361
msgid "Corporation name"
msgstr "Corporation 이름"

#: models.py:362
msgid "Tax value"
msgstr "세금 금액"

#: models.py:363
msgid "Tax percentage"
msgstr "Ingame Corp Tax"

#: models.py:364 templates/eos_tax/index.html:45
#: templates/eos_tax/index.html:94
msgid "Paid"
msgstr "납부완료"

#: models.py:381
msgid "Applied alliance tax rate"
msgstr "적용된 Alliance 세율"

#: models.py:384
msgid ""
"Alliance rate in effect when this row was calculated. Stored per row so "
"changing the rate does not rewrite what past months were owed."
msgstr ""
"이 행을 계산할 때 적용되던 Alliance 세율입니다. 행마다 저장하므로 세율을 바꾸"
"어도 이미 지난 달들의 납부액은 바뀌지 않습니다."

#: models.py:390
msgid "Amount to pay"
msgstr "납부액"

#: models.py:393
msgid ""
"ISK owed to the alliance for this month, in whole ISK. Worked out from "
"tax_value, tax_percentage and alliance_tax_rate whenever the row is written, "
"and kept with them from then on - the page, the chart and the payment check "
"read it rather than redoing the arithmetic."
msgstr ""
"이번 달 Alliance에 납부할 금액으로, 정수 ISK 단위입니다. 행을 기록할 때마다 "
"tax_value, tax_percentage, alliance_tax_rate로 계산해 함께 보관하며, 페이지·"
"차트·납부 확인은 다시 계산하지 않고 이 값을 읽습니다."

